{% comment %}
==================================================================
 Pretty Calendar — shared
 1. Settings         4. Calendar data (days + agenda)
 2. Translations     5. Styles
 3. Date & time      6. Templates (header, grid, agenda, day, event)
==================================================================
{% endcomment %}


